#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: buildVars.py:21
msgid "Count elements of the selected text"
msgstr "Contar elementos del texto seleccionado"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid ""
"announces the number of words, characters and paragraphs of the selected "
"text pressing Control+Shift+F12.\n"
"\tIt also can create a list of the words used, ordered by number of "
"occcurrences or alphabetically, display the lines containing a word and "
"finally move to a specific line, pressing Control+Shift+F11."
msgstr ""
"anuncia el número de palabras, caracteres y párrafos del texto seleccionado "
"pulsando Control+Mayúsculas+F12.\n"
"\tTambién puede crear una lista de las palabras utilizadas, ordenadas por "
"número de ocurrencias o alfabéticamente, mostrar las líneas que contienen "
"una palabra y, por último, desplazarse a una línea concreta, pulsando "
"Control+Mayúsculas+F11."

